enc=lambda n:base64.b64encode((P/n).read_bytes()).decode();html='<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>California Scrub-Jay: one missing blink</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui;max-width:1080px;margin:30px auto;background:#e7e3d1;color:#24342b}img{image-rendering:pixelated;background:#d9d4bd;margin:12px;vertical-align:middle}pre{white-space:pre-wrap}</style><h1>California Scrub-Jay: one new closed eye, existing awake reused</h1><p>ONE native drawing only. The original awake source and192px PNG are unchanged. The native tool returned1254px instead of1024px; conversion uses only whole-canvas density normalization, no pose or silhouette fit. Existing canvas/density/pivot/contacts retained; inspect actual old-open/new-closed compatibility at normal yard size.100ms closed in3second loop.</p><p><button onclick="document.querySelectorAll(\'img\').forEach(i=>i.style.background=\'#d9d4bd\')">Light ground</button> <button onclick="document.querySelectorAll(\'img\').forEach(i=>i.style.background=\'#17221f\')">Dark ground</button></p><h2>Normal yard size and enlarged inspection</h2>'
